# AI OS Shell UI Standards

## CSS custom properties are the ONLY theming mechanism

The shell theme is driven by `src/index.css` `--panel-*` custom properties stamped by `useShellTheme → themeToCssVars()`. All components inherit passively from these tokens.

### Required token usage

| Purpose | Token |
|---------|-------|
| Panel/card background | `var(--panel-bg)` |
| Secondary surface | `var(--panel-surface)` |
| Hover state | `var(--panel-bg-hover)` |
| Border | `var(--panel-border)` |
| Input background | `var(--panel-input-bg)` |
| Input border | `var(--panel-input-border)` |
| Body text | `var(--panel-text)` |
| Muted/secondary text | `var(--panel-text-muted)` |
| Heading text | `var(--panel-heading)` |
| Accent background | `var(--panel-accent-bg)` |
| Accent border | `var(--panel-accent-border)` |
| Accent text | `var(--panel-accent-text)` |

### Correct pattern

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT — CSS custom properties via style=
<div style={{ background: 'var(--panel-bg)', border: '1px solid var(--panel-border)' }}>
  <p style={{ color: 'var(--panel-text)' }}>Content</p>
  <span style={{ color: 'var(--panel-text-muted)' }}>Secondary</span>
</div>

// ✅ CORRECT — use tileButtonClass() helper for interactive tiles
import { tileButtonClass } from './tileButtonHelpers';
<button className={tileButtonClass(isActive)}>Tile</button>
```

### PROHIBITED patterns — never use these

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG — hardcoded Tailwind opacity utilities break the theme
<div className="bg-white/[0.03] border-white/10 bg-slate-950/95">
<p className="text-zinc-400 text-zinc-500 text-zinc-600">
<div className="bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/15">

// ❌ WRONG — hardcoded dark colors
<div className="bg-slate-900 bg-zinc-950 bg-black/40">
```

## Layout tokens

- Header height: `var(--shell-header-height)` = `2.75rem`
- Footer height: `var(--shell-footer-height)` = `6rem`
- Content top padding: `pt-[calc(var(--shell-header-height)+2.5rem)]`
- Content bottom padding: `pb-[calc(var(--shell-footer-height)+1.25rem)]`

## Z-index layers (do not use raw numbers)

```
--z-shell-base: 0
--z-shell-main: 10
--z-shell-chrome: 40
--z-shell-workspace-canvas: 60
--z-shell-header: 70
--z-shell-footer: 70
--z-shell-modal-backdrop: 65
--z-shell-system-controls: 75
```
